Description: Fix CVE-2026-12802 - allow CMS recipients to require a minimum AEAD tag size
 AuthEnvelopedData recipients did not enforce a caller-chosen AEAD authentication
 tag length floor, so an attacker could downgrade a GCM/CCM ICV to a weaker size.
